{
  "id": "sleep",
  "title": "住店、夜间与睡到天亮",
  "requirements": [
    "T4",
    "T5",
    "L1"
  ],
  "turns": [
    {
      "input": "我到青灯酒馆，付六铜住一晚。",
      "assertions": [
        {
          "kind": "equals",
          "path": "state.location",
          "value": "bld_hw_qingdeng"
        },
        {
          "kind": "delta",
          "path": "state.player.coins",
          "value": -6
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "input": "我问林穗现在是什么时辰，今天店里几点安静下来。",
      "assertions": [
        {
          "kind": "delta",
          "path": "state.player.coins",
          "value": 0
        },
        {
          "kind": "elapsed",
          "min": 5,
          "max": 20
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "input": "我在租下的房间休息到今天晚上二十三点，期间不买卖。",
      "assertions": [
        {
          "kind": "delta",
          "path": "state.player.coins",
          "value": 0
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "input": "我走到小学堂门口，不敲门也不进去。",
      "assertions": [
        {
          "kind": "equals",
          "path": "state.location",
          "value": "bld_hw_school"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "input": "这么晚我试着请陆青立刻开课；如果他休息或闭门就不学、不付钱。",
      "assertions": [
        {
          "kind": "delta",
          "path": "state.player.coins",
          "value": 0
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "input": "我回青灯酒馆自己的客房。",
      "assertions": [
        {
          "kind": "equals",
          "path": "state.location",
          "value": "bld_hw_qingdeng"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "input": "我现在睡到明天早上六点，期间不做别的事。",
      "assertions": [
        {
          "kind": "delta",
          "path": "state.player.coins",
          "value": 0
        },
        {
          "kind": "range",
          "path": "state.minute",
          "min": 1800,
          "max": 1815
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "input": "（场外）核对醒来时间，以及生命和魔力是否按休息结算。",
      "assertions": [
        {
          "kind": "elapsed",
          "min": 0,
          "max": 0
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "initial": {
    "mode": "new"
